---
import {petitionTrace,passagesForAssessment} from '../lib/research-library';
const trace=petitionTrace,passage=trace?passagesForAssessment(trace.assessment)[0]:undefined;
---
{trace&&passage&&<section class="library-trace wrap section" id="claim-trace" aria-labelledby="trace-title"><p class="kicker">FOLLOW ONE REAL RESEARCH TRAIL</p><h2 id="trace-title">A book record is a beginning.<br/><em>A passage is a narrower claim.</em></h2><p>The Abẹ́òkúta draft already contains this attributed account. Open the comparison to see how its support differs from a bibliographic record.</p><details class="trace-disclosure"><summary>Follow the petition to printed page 78 / PDF page 106</summary><div class="trace-columns"><section><h3>Bibliographic context</h3><p>{trace.assessment.workTitle}</p><p>{trace.assessment.creator}</p><p>{trace.assessment.edition}</p><p>A book’s identity and edition do not verify every statement in it. No full-book audit is claimed.</p></section><section class="trace-passage"><h3>Exact previously inspected passage</h3><p class="trace-locator">{passage.locator}</p><p>{passage.limits}</p><a href={passage.href}>Open the corrected source locator in the story</a></section></div><section class="trace-claim"><h3>How the draft uses it</h3><p>{trace.paragraph.text}</p><a href={trace.storyHref}>Return to the original attributed paragraph</a><p class="fine">This is scholarly mediation of the underlying documents, not independently inspected AWU papers or authenticated testimony collected by this project.</p></section></details><p class="fine">Evidence Explorer demonstration · private research draft · independent review and public-release permission outstanding.</p></section>}
